      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 46,
      "hadithIndex": 2936,
      "bookHadithIndex": 10,
      "text": "Narrated Ibn 'Umar:that he recited the following to the Prophet (ﷺ): \"Who created you in the weakness (Min Da'f)\" So he said: \"Min Du'f\" (Another chain) with similar in meaning",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-46-2936-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
